sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W1 as Worker 1
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant W2 as Worker 2

    W1->>DB: BEGIN & SELECT FOR UPDATE (Lock row)
    W2->>DB: BEGIN & SELECT FOR UPDATE (Blocks waiting)
    W1->>DB: UPDATE payment_intents SET status = 'PROCESSING'
    W1->>DB: COMMIT (Releases lock)
    DB-->>W2: Lock granted (Reads updated status 'PROCESSING')
    W2->>DB: Status precondition fails -> Abort Worker 2 execution
